  "notes": [
    "Irregular -ER verb: c→zc before o and a (same pattern as Conocer, Parecer, Ofrecer)",
    "Affects yo presente (*merezco*) and all subjuntivo presente forms (*merezca, merezcas, merezca, merezcamos, merezcan*)",
    "All other tenses are fully regular",
    "Past participle: merecido (regular)",
    "*Merecer la pena* = to be worth it: *Merece la pena intentarlo* = It's worth trying",
    "*Se lo merece* = He/she deserves it",
    "*Lo tiene merecido* = He/she had it coming",
    "Related: merecido/a (deserved), merecidamente (deservedly), el mérito (merit)"
  ],
